flowchart TB
    M["<b>1. A mistake is found</b><br/>a failing eval case,<br/>or an underwriter override,<br/>logged with its reason"]
    C["<b>2. It becomes a case</b><br/>with the right answer,<br/>confirmed by a person"]
    H["<b>3. One change, with a hypothesis</b><br/>a rule, a prompt or a threshold"]
    R["<b>4. Rerun the whole suite</b><br/>make eval: fresh services,<br/>recorded model answers, every grader"]
    G{"<b>5. Keep or discard?</b><br/>the new case passes,<br/>nothing else breaks,<br/>held-back cases hold,<br/>no critical error"}
    K["<b>Keep</b><br/>decision row in results.jsonl;<br/>the case stays as a permanent test.<br/>Back to step 1 for the next mistake."]
    D["<b>Discard</b><br/>decision row records why.<br/>Back to step 3: try another change."]

    M --> C --> H --> R --> G
    G -- "yes" --> K
    G -- "no" --> D

    subgraph TRUTH["What the suite checks against"]
        direction LR
        L["Lead labels<br/>from the playbook, signed"]
        A["Stand's answer key"]
        HB["Held-back replies"]
        CT["Case tables"]
    end

    TRUTH -.-> R

    classDef step fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#0b1b3a
    classDef gate fill:#fef9c3,stroke:#a16207,color:#422006
    classDef keep fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,color:#052e16
    classDef drop fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#450a0a
    classDef truth fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#64748b,color:#0f172a
    class M,C,H,R step
    class G gate
    class K keep
    class D drop
    class L,A,HB,CT truth
